	(text "J4 male 2x4 SMD (Boom PZ254), inner face = B.Cu.\nPin=line: 1=L8, 2=L1, 3=L7, 4=L2\n5=L6, 6=L3, 7=L5, 8=L4\nNet of each pin = net of the J3 pad it touches\n(tree_common.j4_pin_net / mate_table).\nNo supply, no ground: the lines are the only nets."
